This project is an open-source, review-gated video production Skill. It covers
audio and visual planning, edit decision lists, a measured timeline, semantic
captions, overlay and animation authoring, compositing, self-check, and verified
delivery.

## Provenance

This Skill is a merge of two upstream projects and was decoupled from both on
2026-09-15. `upstream-diff.md` records what was absorbed and what deliberately
diverges. Both upstream copies are preserved read-only under `archive/`.

- `browser-use/video-use` — MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Browser Use.
  Contributed the time spine, the compositor, the caption chain, and delivery
  verification. Its MIT license text is preserved verbatim at
  `archive/video-use/LICENSE`.
- `web-video-presentation` (from `github.com/ConardLi/garden-skills`) —
  contributed the visual-layer authoring surface, alpha encoding, and the visual
  review loop.

Credential handling note: the Doubao App ID and access token that upstream
inlined as string literals in `helpers/doubao_asr_file.js` have been redacted to
`DOUBAO_APP_ID` / `DOUBAO_ACCESS_TOKEN` from the environment (falling back to
`<repo>/.env`), in both the live helper and the frozen `archive/video-use/` copy.
See `upstream-diff.md` for why.

The review faces (visual review and EDL cut preview) are served by the shared
review seam (`planners-review-core`) and are meant to run locally only.

Attribution and source identification may appear in repository documents,
process HTML pages, review server pages, validation pages, and developer
workflow surfaces. The Skill should not add project branding to final client
deliverables by default unless the user explicitly requests it.
